OL,3,ABBC News presenter reveals she has
OL,4,Ablood cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC News presenter Maryam Moshiri has
OL,7,Frevealed she is living with blood
OL,8,Fcancer.
OL,10,FMoshiri, who joined the BBC in 2003 and
OL,11,Fis one of the news channel's best-known
OL,12,Fanchors, told the BBC she wanted to
OL,13,Fshare her diagnosis to raise awareness
OL,14,Fabout the disease.
OL,16,F"It's been two years since my diagnosis
OL,17,Fand I've felt that I've started to
OL,18,Funderstand the disease a lot better and
OL,19,Fthe way it affects my life. I've got a
OL,20,Fhandle on it to a degree now, so I felt
OL,21,Fit was really important to raise
OL,22,Fawareness," the 49-year-old said.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
